map.某住宅小区 500 户，位于大城市，指标 0.8 车位/户：\n总车位 = 50:
A residential community of 500 households in a metropolis, with a standard of 0.8 spaces per household:
Total spaces = 500 × 0.8 = 400 spaces (divisor=1, since residential is counted per "household");
Visitor spaces 10% → 40 spaces, regular spaces 360 spaces;
Accessible spaces = max(1, ceil(400×2%)) = 8 spaces (included within the regular spaces);
Parking area ≈ 400 × 25 = 10000 m² (about 1.0 ha).

map.某办公楼建筑面积 50000 m²，大城市指标 0.8 车位/100m²：\n总:
An office building of 50000 m² floor area, with a metropolis standard of 0.8 spaces per 100 m²:
Total spaces = 50000 / 100 × 0.8 = 400 spaces;
Visitor 5% → 20 spaces, regular 380 spaces, accessible 8 spaces;
Parking area ≈ 400 × 35 = 14000 m².
